null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["今天2大用餐，是在美食街的拉麵，但有自己吧台可坐，坐吧台點250以上，現在還有贈3樣小菜，用餐環境舒適。\n\n點了雞白濃湯不死鳥(小辣)和京都綿密系月讀，不死鳥小辣就滿有感覺了，味道好吃不會死鹹和太濃郁，麵條有吸到湯的滋味，叉燒軟嫩好吃，份量看來不大，但吃得很飽。綿密系的話湯頭喝來比較細，湯頭比較清爽，但味道也是有，看個人喜好，推薦給喜歡拉麵的朋友😁",null,[0,52]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1987814725024032176/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBCZWxZd1JrNWtiRlpTVG1wV2JGWlZaSGhTTVhCSllWUlNjMU5yUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1987814725024032176/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBCZWxZd1JrNWtiRlpTVG1wV2JGWlZaSGhTTVhCSllWUlNjMU5yUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/1987814725024032176/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBCZWxZd1JrNWtiRlpTVG1wV2JGWlZaSGhTTVhCSllWUlNjMU5yUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1987814725024032176/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBCZWxZd1JrNWtiRlpTVG1wV2JGWlZaSGhTTVhCSllWUlNjMU5yUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1987814725024032176/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBCZWxZd1JrNWtiRlpTVG1wV2JGWlZaSGhTTVhCSllWUlNjMU5yUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1987814725024032176/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBCZWxZd1JrNWtiRlpTVG1wV2JGWlZaSGhTTVhCSllWUlNjMU5yUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,2872,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pBelYwRk5kbFZSTmpWbFZVZHhSMXBJYVRSc1NrRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x671322ed2849be29!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjAzV0FNdlVRNjVlVUdxR1pIaTRsSkE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pBelYwRk5kbFZSTmpWbFZVZHhSMXBJYVRSc1NrRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pBelYwRk5kbFZSTmpWbFZVZHhSMXBJYVRSc1NrRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pBelYwRk5kbFZSTmpWbFZVZHhSMXBJYVRSc1NrRRILMGRDMUJKLVJxSEkaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09qQXp